<h3 class="bold" id="hint-tooltip-and-messages"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="rangeslider#hint-tooltip-and-messages">Hint, Tooltip and Messages</a></h3>
<p>Hint, tooltip and messages must also be in relationship with the handle using <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">aria-describedby</span></span></code></span>. When multiple handles are used, authors are responsible to pick whether it makes more sense to describe all or just some of the handles.</p>
<pre><div class="language-javascript" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><pre class="language-javascript pre-block"><code class="code prism-code language-javascript code-block"><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token spread operator" style="color:hsl(221, 87%, 60%)">...</span><span class="token plain"></span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)">handleAttributes</span><span class="token operator" style="color:hsl(221, 87%, 60%)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">[</span><span class="token plain"></span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token string-property property" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)">&#x27;aria-label&#x27;</span><span class="token operator" style="color:hsl(221, 87%, 60%)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">&#x27;Price from&#x27;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token string-property property" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)">&#x27;aria-describedby&#x27;</span><span class="token operator" style="color:hsl(221, 87%, 60%)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">&#x27;hint-id tooltip-id message-0&#x27;</span><span class="token plain"></span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230