<h2 class="bold" id="js-module-reference"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="rangeslider#js-module-reference">JS Module Reference</a></h2>
<p>All elements with <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">[data-rangeslider]</span></span></code></span> will be initialised automatically on <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/DOMContentLoaded_event" class="underline"><span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">DOMContentLoaded</span></span></code></span> event</a>.</p>
<h3 class="bold" id="config"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="rangeslider#config">Config</a></h3>
<p>The module is configured either by passing a JSON string representing a <a href="https://refreshless.com/nouislider/slider-options/" class="underline">noUiSlider config</a> object through <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">[data-rangeslider]</span></span></code></span> attribute or during <a href="rangeslider#manual-initialisation" class="underline">manual initialisation</a>.</p>
<p>When configuring the module through <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">[data-rangeslider]</span></span></code></span>, the format attribute expects a <a href="https://refreshless.com/wnumb/" class="underline">wNumb</a> config object instead of a function. In case you need a custom formatting fuction, omit the <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">data-rangeslider</span></span></code></span> attribute and <a href="rangeslider#manual-initialisation" class="underline">initialize the module manually</a>.</p>
